OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Ukranian pianist Vadym
OL,6,     GKholodenko performs works by
OL,7,     GBeethoven, Lyatoshinsky, and
OL,8,     GLiszt in concert at Wigmore Hall
OL,9,     Gin London.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,11,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,12,     Gdisappointments of the creative
OL,13,     Glife. Creative disappointment,
OL,14,     Gwhich often follows years of
OL,15,     Gsolitary work, is, she feels, one
OL,16,     Gof the worst kinds.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
